### @name updateCustomArticleFeed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/article-feeds/{{customArticleFeedId}}
Host: {{tenantAHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{subscriberAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "{{customArticleFeedTitle}} updated",
  "categoryIds": [{{articleCategoryId}}]
}

> {%
    client.test("Update custom article feed", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200");
        client.assert(response.body.data.title.indexOf("updated") !== -1, "Expected updated title");
        client.assert(response.body.data.isDefault === false, "Expected custom feed");
    });
%}

